Midnight, a theme for RiftWii: the default look in dark colours.

To the extent possible under law, the author has waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to this theme (its theme.ini), under
Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The theme is colours only: RiftWii paints every picture itself in them.
It keeps RiftWii's own sounds and music.

Third-party parts: none.
